{"3880400":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"FRUKT","steam_appid":3880400,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRUKT<\/strong> is a death sandbox where every kill becomes an experiment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill, dismember, and torment highly detailed voxel-based humanoids. Every bone breaks, every muscle tears, every organ reacts to damage. No rules, no story - only death.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dismemberment<\/strong>: tear off limbs, slice everything into pieces - body is fully physical and voxel-based.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional organs<\/strong>: the heart pumps blood, the brain controls the body, muscles hold strength. Hit the heart and the ragdoll will bleed out. Destroy the brain and it dies instantly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical balance<\/strong>: victims react naturally to all impacts, trying to stay on their feet and falling like real humans.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic movement<\/strong>: every step depends on muscle strength and the surface below. Break the legs and watch them fail to hold the body.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to support development?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add FRUKT to your Steam wishlist and don’t miss the release!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to share ideas and follow updates?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRUKT<\/strong> is a death sandbox where every kill becomes an experiment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill, dismember, and torment highly detailed voxel-based humanoids. Every bone breaks, every muscle tears, every organ reacts to damage. No rules, no story - only death.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dismemberment<\/strong>: tear off limbs, slice everything into pieces - body is fully physical and voxel-based.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional organs<\/strong>: the heart pumps blood, the brain controls the body, muscles hold strength. Hit the heart and the ragdoll will bleed out. Destroy the brain and it dies instantly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical balance<\/strong>: victims react naturally to all impacts, trying to stay on their feet and falling like real humans.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic movement<\/strong>: every step depends on muscle strength and the surface below. Break the legs and watch them fail to hold the body.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.poster.avif?t=1790714637\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.webm?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/extras\/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.mp4?t=1790714637\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to support development?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add FRUKT to your Steam wishlist and don’t miss the release!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to share ideas and follow updates?<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community!<\/p>","short_description":"A voxel-based death sandbox. Shoot, dismember, and crush NPCs with realistic body physics.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/791f0bd4e57916d7c3300db4660c040ca6b1a7c5\/header.jpg?t=1790714637","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/d44bdf22842081b753fe5e44a5f864702c90c460\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1790714637","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3880400\/d44bdf22842081b753fe5e44a5f864702c90c460\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1790714637","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> TDA<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> TDA<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> TDA<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> TDA<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron